# The project tile picture the Editor writes beside the .deproj on every project save
# (EditorLayer::WriteProjectThumbnail -> `<project>/.thumbnail.png`, the name the launcher looks for).
# For this repository that lands as Editor/.thumbnail.png, where it sat untracked and unignored: three
# different people reported it as unexplained dirt in `git status` inside one day. It is a screenshot of
# whatever the last person had in their viewport, rewritten on every save — derived, per-machine, and
# not something a clone should receive. Unanchored so it covers any project directory, not just ours.
.thumbnail.png

