__pycache__/
*.pyc

# AN AGENT'S BRIEF IS A ONE-OFF INSTRUCTION, NOT REPOSITORY CONTENT.
# E4 committed its own BRIEF.md on 2026-09-23 and the integrator merged it, so a single agent's
# finished brief sat at the repository root looking like documentation -- naming a worktree path and
# a branch that no longer exist. That is the stale-citation shape this project keeps paying for, and
# a file at the root is the most authoritative-looking place to put one.
# The brief the agents actually share is .claude/AGENT_BRIEF_COMMON.md (core) + AGENT_BRIEF_REFERENCE.md, both tracked.
/BRIEF.md

